you in terms of the digital divide, the introduction of technologies like cell phones and internet and social media, does that have an impact on the way that you conduct your social connections? This data collection happened before and after COVID. Some are also interested in the impact of the pandemic and, again, which side of the social divide you were on and how that might have helped you navigate or hindered your navigation during the pandemic. So last question, what's next for the study? Are you enrolling yet another generation of participants are collecting different data? There are other research questions that you want to pursue? There are. We're still, I feel like it's an important resource and we're trying to steward it properly.
手机、互联网和社交媒体等技术的引入，是否对你进行社交联系的方式产生了影响？这些数据收集发生在新冠疫情之前和之后。有些人也对疫情的影响感兴趣，同样，你处于社会鸿沟的哪一边，以及这可能如何帮助你应对或阻碍了你在疫情期间的应对。最后一个问题，这项研究的下一步是什么？你们是否正在招募新一代的参与者，或者在收集不同的数据？还有其他你们想要追求的研究问题吗？有的。我们仍然觉得这是一个重要的资源，我们正在努力妥善管理它。

